{"version":1,"key":"quest:184","content":{"id":184,"title":"什么是 OffscreenCanvas，它可以解决什么问题？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:184","type":"quest","id":184},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"OffscreenCanvas 在 Worker 中实现无阻塞渲染","meta":"","excerpt":"OffscreenCanvas 提供了一个脱离屏幕渲染的画布，它不依赖 DOM 环境，可以在 Worker 中执行。 一般的 Canvas 在主线程中创建和渲染，如果存在大量粒子、复杂图表等耗时渲染逻辑，就会阻塞主线程，导致页面卡顿。而 OffscreenCanvas 允许我们将渲染过程放到 Worker 线程中执行，","target":{"key":"card:755","type":"card","id":755},"citeKey":"card:755"}],"trail":[{"time":1780277391796,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1781065448343,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1781105662644,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"createTime":1780277391796,"updateTime":1780277391796,"resolvedTime":1781105662644},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1780277391796}}